 ('Choose a game guide', '<p>Use the <a href="/free-fire-settings">Free Fire setup guide</a> or <a href="/pubg-settings">PUBG Mobile setup guide</a> for suggested bindings. These are starting points to customize, not guaranteed compatible presets.</p>'),
