 ('Separate sensitivity from connection problems', '<p>Overshooting a target can call for a lower setting. Missing input, disconnects, and pauses require a <a href="/troubleshooting">connection check</a>. Changing sensitivity will not repair an unstable adapter or expired activation.</p>'),
